# ============================================
# SCENARIO 15: Daily Slop Detection
# ============================================

### 15a. Post a Travle result
POST {{host}}/test/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guildId": 1,
  "channelId": 1,
  "userId": 1,
  "messageId": 15001,
  "content": "#travle #1298 +2",
  "embeds": [{ "url": "https://travle.earth/" }]
}

> {%
    client.test("POST returns 200", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected status 200");
    });
%}

